        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Satya Nadella recently cited Morgan Stanley’s ROIC report as demonstrating the returns are there for Token As a Service (TaaS) businesses – a 31% ROIC for Hyperscaler IaaS business and another 46% ROIC at the TaaS layer! (1/4)",
